# ============================================================
# CelebrAI Event Planner — Environment Configuration Example
# ============================================================
# To enable live GenAI capabilities (gemini-3.8-flash):
# 1. Obtain an API key from Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com)
# 2. Rename or copy this file to `.env.local`
# 3. Add your key below:
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Note: If GEMINI_API_KEY is not provided, CelebrAI runs in Demo Mode
# with deterministic, comprehensive planning templates.
